Changes: 400 items sampled (seed 0) from those with one annotated answer
and no time-dated wording; "?" and an answer-format instruction appended
to each question; the answer list reduced to its one string; fields
renamed to the ste-tax task schema. The adaptation is released under the
same license. Regenerate: see docs/tasks.md.
